 "blend_mode": "BLEND_Translucent",
 "two_sided": false,
 "resolve": false,
 "resolve_note": "forward translucent unlit (not a toon GBuffer): output Emissive + Opacity to a UE translucent unlit material. Kuro engine tail, not ported (UE applies its own): opacity *= Kuro primitive fade (Primitive[43]); colour = max(E, 0) (*View[285] unless Primitive[42].w), OOB stripes, vertex fog (TEXCOORD7) / volumetric fog, Kuro effect colour grading (View[283]/[279], View[286].x/[284]); o0 = (rgb, opacity) with the material blend mode, o1 = (0, 1, 0, opacity). Verified with that tail reproduced in the harness (tools/shaderdiff/weapons/hlsl/kuro_translucent_tail.hlsli).",
 "vs_note": "VS #212887 0cc315c508: only the E_Absorbed WPO (x WPOIntensity), branched on E_Absorbed_Enable > 0.5 = 0 at every roster MI (gated_wpo, evidence/validation/shaderdiff/weapons/round3/waterfx/vs_status_waterfx.json); not ported.",
